This is a Progressive Web App template built with Vite, React 18, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.

Key features:
- Service worker with Workbox for offline support and caching
- Install prompt hook for Add to Home Screen functionality
- Online status detection hook
- Tailwind CSS with dark mode support and custom animations
- Path aliases via @/* mapping to src/*

When extending this template:
- Place pages/routes in src/pages/
- Place reusable components in src/components/
- Place shared utilities in src/lib/
- Place custom hooks in src/hooks/
- Add PWA icons to public/icons/ (192x192 and 512x512 PNG)
